==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*dьrnǫti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-дёрнуть.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|дёрнуть|pf|impf=дёргать}}

# to [[pull]], to [[tug]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''дёрнуть''' [[кто-либо|кого́-либо]] [[за]] [[рука́в]]|to pull someone's sleeve; tug at someone's sleeve}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[и]] '''дёрнуло''' [[я|меня́]]!|what (on earth) possessed me!|lit=and it '''pulled''' me!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[чёрт]] [[я|меня́]] '''дёрнул'''!|what (on earth) possessed me!|lit=the devil '''pulled''' me!}}
# to [[pull out]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''дёрнуть''' [[зуб]]|to pull out a tooth}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal|colloquial}} to [[twitch]], to [[throb]], to [[twinge]]
# to [[move]] [[sharply]], to [[jerk]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[лошадь|ло́шади]] '''дёрнули'''|the horses gave a jerk}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[disturb]]
# {{lb|ru|low colloquial}} to [[drink]], to [[knock back]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''дёрнем''' [[ещё]] [[по]] [[рюмочка|рю́мочке]]|let's knock back another one}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[set out]], to [[go out]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1856|author=w:ru:Лев Толстой<t:{{w|Leo Tolstoy}}>|title=w:ru:[[Два гусара (повесть)|Два гусара]]|chapter=s:ru:[[Два_гусара_(Толстой)#I|I]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:en:Aylmer and Louise Maude|title2=s:en:[[Two_Hussars#I|Two Hussars]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1901|page2=|pageurl2=|text=— Са́шка! дава́й бельё: пое́ду в ба́ню, — сказа́л граф, встава́я. — А отту́да, посмо́трим, мо́жет, и в са́мом де́ле к предводи́телю '''дёрнуть'''.|t="Sashka, get my clean linen ready. I am going to the bath," said the count, rising, "and from there perhaps I may '''look in''' at the Marshal's."}}

